WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — prov-dramabox-42000021392 — Episode 3 — English subtitles
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-27 from the real episode audio (faster-whisper small).

1
00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.500
Holy hell.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:05.540
The stories didn't do it justice, the Valmont stronghold.

3
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.540
It's massive.

4
00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.880
But where is the Primitor God?

5
00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:16.850
The legendary dragonlots.

6
00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:22.850
Heavenbreaker, used by the first Valmont commander, Lord Magneus,

7
00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:26.850
to ground the great dragon that nearly brought the realm to its knees.

8
00:00:26.850 --> 00:00:30.130
Hey, little guy.

9
00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.130
We don't belong in stories like this.

10
00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.130
Let's just find the Duke so he can save you.

11
00:00:34.130 --> 00:00:49.650
Run, Vey. Cain wants my seat. To him, you're just a foster kid.

12
00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:52.650
Get out of here, and he won't bother hunting you down.

13
00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:53.650
You are my father.

14
00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.650
I'm not leaving you here to die like a dog.

15
00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:57.650
I'm gonna butcher every last one of those traitors.

16
00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:01.650
You haven't even passed the resonance trials to be a fully patched dragonite yet, Bec.

17
00:01:01.650 --> 00:01:02.650
You can't take it.

18
00:01:02.650 --> 00:01:05.650
Listen to me. My son, the one I lost,

19
00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:08.650
he has a dark red birthmark on his left shoulder blade.

20
00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:13.650
If you ever find him, tell him, I'm sorry.

21
00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:16.650
Left shoulder blade? Red birthmark?

22
00:01:16.650 --> 00:01:19.650
Well, that's one hell of a coincidence.

23
00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:22.950
Lord Valmont!

24
00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:25.950
Your peacekeeping is getting the Obsidian Order to lose its teeth.

25
00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:29.950
It's only a matter of time before the other three factions swallow us whole.

26
00:01:29.950 --> 00:01:31.950
I'm the only one who can put us back on top.

27
00:01:31.950 --> 00:01:34.950
You treat these dragons like weapons of mass destruction, Cain.

28
00:01:34.950 --> 00:01:41.950
I will never hand the commander's signet ring over to you, not while I'm breathing.

29
00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:46.950
The only one who's with a man bleeding out in the dirt is the legendary Duke Valmont.

30
00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:48.950
The only one who can save you.

31
00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:51.950
My father pulled you out of the gutter and made you a captain.

32
00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:54.950
You ungrateful son of a bitch!

33
00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:57.950
You want his seat? You go through meat first!

34
00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.950
Father, don't kid yourself, Beatrix.

35
00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:03.950
You're just a stray he took in to fill the void of his lost son.

36
00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.950
He's never leaving the Order to an outsider like you, so don't throw your-

37
00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:08.950
Shut your filthy mouth!

38
00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:13.950
Who gets the Order? I'm just making sure it never falls into the hands of a snake like you!

39
00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:16.950
You are a true Dragonite candidate, Bay.

40
00:02:16.950 --> 00:02:21.950
I honestly hope you join my ranks, but it's a damn shame I have to put you in the ground instead.

41
00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:26.950
Oh, man. The only guy who can save you is about to get executed.

42
00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.950
What the hell are we supposed to do?
